","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/18/8780962/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/18/8780962/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お誕生おめでとうございます〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/18/8780962/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/18/8780962/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/18/8780962/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/18/8780962/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/18/8780962/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/18/8780962/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/18/8780962/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/18/8780962/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/18/8780962/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/18/8780962/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/18/8780962/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも優しくしてくれる素敵お姉ちゃまです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/18/8780962/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な1年になりますように"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/18/8780962/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/18/8780962/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は学校で、修学旅行の班を決めたり新幹線やバスの座席表を決めたりしましたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/18/8780962/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/18/8780962/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/18/8780962/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島出身なのに、広島にも行くんだよ...笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/18/8780962/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校終わりに前仕事で受けれなかった健康診断を保健室の先生と生徒とで病院に行って来ましたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/18/8780962/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/18/8780962/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"虫歯もないし、OKだったー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/18/8780962/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"健康診断終わりに撮影に行ったよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/18/8780962/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"星野のみなみちゃまに\n『blog更新しなさーいっ♪』\nって言ったら"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/18/8780962/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『できないの〜』\nって言ってたよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/18/8780962/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">今インターネットに接続出来にくいんだって"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/18/8780962/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/18/8780962/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/18/8780962/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/18/8780962/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/18/8780962/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁそんなこんなで、帰り道はユッキーナ(柏ゆきなちゃん)とおしゃべりしながら帰りましたよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/18/8780962/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/18/8780962/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ユッキーナ靴が壊れちゃって歩き方が面白いことになってた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/18/8780962/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">後で足が痛くなってなければいいんだけど〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/18/8780962/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":">>おしゃべりしてたら楽しくて♪\n>あっという間だったなー！\n>久しぶりにユッキーナに会えたので癒された♪\n>"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/18/8780962/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":">今までは小テストばっかり続いてたけど、 もうすぐ本格的なテストだから頑張ります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/18/8780962/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n>>明日は仕事で朝早いので、\n>>なんかわかんないけど"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/18/8780962/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":">>アミアミ(能條あみちゃん)＆ちーちゃん(さいとーちはるちゃん)が泊まりに来るらしい......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/18/8780962/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">楽しくて寝られるかな...笑\n>"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":">いつも沢山の元気が出るコメントをありがとうございます。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/18/8780962/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">まあやのパワーの源だよ〜!!\n>\n>本当に最近は初コメさんが増えてて\n>嬉しいです(T^T)\n>ありがとうです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/18/8780962/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大坂→大阪の間違い教えてくれてありがとう〜汗"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では\n久しぶりに広島弁で"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/18/8780962/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「皆も風邪ひいたりせんで〜よ〜\n元気じゃないといけんけ〜な〜」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「読み逃げしたらハブテルヨ〜」笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/18/8780962/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"※メイドの生駒ちゃん！いつも『まあやまあや』っていってくれてありがとーアイラブユー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/18/8780962/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/18/8780962/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/18/8780962/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/18/8780962/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/18/8780962/0017.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}